{"id":"97b68cd750e79cac","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-solovay-realization.md","title":"Solovay Realization","display":"df-solovay-realization — Solovay Realization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-solovay-realization","aliases":["89-df-solovay-realization"],"display":"df-solovay-realization — Solovay Realization","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","[[89-df-realization-function]]","[[89-df-solovay-function]]","[[89-df-gl-finite-model]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[49-df-linear-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-solovay-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-solovay-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-solovay-realization — Solovay Realization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a50ebde4b7b3e426\" href=\"?note=a50ebde4b7b3e426\" title=\"89-df-realization-function\">89-df-realization-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2b62c1bcece60ed\" href=\"?note=b2b62c1bcece60ed\" title=\"89-df-solovay-function\">89-df-solovay-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5026751112f75f31\" href=\"?note=5026751112f75f31\" title=\"89-df-gl-finite-model\">89-df-gl-finite-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a href=\"?unresolved=49-df-linear-order\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-7\" data-link-target=\"49-df-linear-order\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">49-df-linear-order<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> is a set of Kripke models and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,\\prec)\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}\">\\((W,\\prec)\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}\\)</span> is the finite ordering used in the\ncorresponding Solovay construction.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(w)=L_w\">\\(L(w)=L_w\\)</span>, is its fixed family of\nPA sentences.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> are the\nrealization-assignment and structural-realization sets from their defining\natoms.</li>\n<li>For finite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq W\">\\(S\\subseteq W\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{\\prec}(S)\\in W^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(e_{\\prec}(S)\\in W^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is the unique\nincreasing enumeration of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is the finite-sequence disjunction fold on PA\nsentences, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nr_{\\sigma}&amp;:\\mathrm{Prop}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\nr_{\\sigma}(p)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\bigl(L\\circ e_{\\prec}(V(p))\\bigr),\\\\\nr_{\\sigma}&amp;\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n\\tau_{\\sigma}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau_{\\mathrm{PA},r_{\\sigma}}\n\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nr_{\\sigma}&amp;:\\mathrm{Prop}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\nr_{\\sigma}(p)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\bigl(L\\circ e_{\\prec}(V(p))\\bigr),\\\\\nr_{\\sigma}&amp;\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n\\tau_{\\sigma}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau_{\\mathrm{PA},r_{\\sigma}}\n\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(p)\\subseteq W\">\\(V(p)\\subseteq W\\)</span> 有限，故其有序枚举和有限析取均良定义；空赋值集\n被送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>该原子只构造算术实现。它是否忠实反映给定 Kripke 模型、以及由此\n得到的 GL 算术完备性，都是需要证明的后续结论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-realization-function","status":"resolved","id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-realization-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-solovay-function","status":"resolved","id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-finite-model","status":"resolved","id":"5026751112f75f31","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-finite-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"49-df-linear-order","status":"missing","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[49-df-linear-order]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"(W,\\prec)\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"L(w)=L_w","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq W","display":false},{"tex":"e_{\\prec}(S)\\in W^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\math